      </strong>
     </div>
     <div class="card" style="text-align:center;padding:16px;">
      <strong style="font-size:13.5px;">
       Gudang Parcell
      </strong>
     </div>
     <div class="card" style="text-align:center;padding:16px;">
      <strong style="font-size:13.5px;">
       Samudra Cipta Rasa
      </strong>
     </div>
     <div class="card" style="text-align:center;padding:16px;">
      <strong style="font-size:13.5px;">
       Surya Painting
      </strong>
     </div>
     <div class="card" style="text-align:center;padding:16px;">
      <strong style="font-size:13.5px;">
       Serona Kopitiam
      </strong>
     </div>
     <div class="card" style="text-align:center;padding:16px;">
      <strong style="font-size:13.5px;">
       MamaKoko
      </strong>
     </div>
     <div class="card" style="text-align:center;padding:16px;">
      <strong style="font-size:13.5px;">
